      "title": "Getting Started: Text2Img",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Win Models Text2Img Template\n\nGeneric text-to-image workflow with a checkpoint loader, Multi LoRA Stack, StringReplace prompt templates, sampler, VAE decode, and save node.\n\nChoose a checkpoint, edit the positive and negative template strings, then queue the prompt."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -690,
        610
      ],
      "size": [
        460,
        350
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "FAQ",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "This template assumes a checkpoint that loads through CheckpointLoaderSimple. It is intended for checkpoint-style SD/SDXL/Pony workflows. Split-loader families such as Flux.2 Klein need separate diffusion model, text encoder, and VAE loader nodes; selecting one in CheckpointLoaderSimple can fail later with an invalid VAE."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
